old-projection (bool)
  use old back-projection method that project image metrics with multi-view SAM

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

with-camera-grouping (bool/object)
  group cameras w.r.t. their distance so that multi-view training, when applied, will only choose cameras within the same group to form a batch

with-camera-grouping.regroup-interval (int)
  number of iterations before the camera groups should be recalculated.
   Cameras are grouped by implementing the FPS algorithm which is inherently stochastic, periodically regrouping the cameras allows nearby cameras that were previously assigned to different groups to be reassigned together, thereby providing richer geometric information.

