trace.capture (bool)
  capture traces for training predictor

trace.validate-capture (bool)
  validate while capture. this implies trace.capture

trace.step-limit (float)
  limitation on number of gaussians that can be densified on each densification step.
   If a value less than 1 is specified, it limits the number of gaussians that may be densified each time up
    to ((current gaussians) * step-limit).
   If a value that is greater than 1 is specified, a scheduler is applied: a value t decreases linearly from
    -1 to -(step-limit) along with training iterations, the number of gaussians that may be densified will be
    limited to (2^t * (current gaussians)) on each densification step.
   If more gaussians were proposed, pick randomly (with uniform distribution) among them.
   Set to 0 to disable this limitation
  
trace.evaluate (bool)
  evaluate accuracy of model prediction. MSE error will be written to <output-dir>/predictor-evaluation

