external-depth (object)
  use external depth to supervise the rendered depth

  .source ("moge" | "vggt")
    source of external depth
  .start-at (number)
    start applying external depth from certain iteration. If not specified, default to the very beginning
  .align ("none" | "mean" | "mean-variance")
    how should the external depth be aligned to the rendered depth
  .use-vggt-point-cloud (bool)
    use point cloud generated by vggt
  .plain-loss (object)
    use external depth as an extra plain loss caused by the rendered depth

    .ratio (float)
      loss ratio
    .softness (object)
      use depth ranking, a softer loss

      .patch-size (int)
        patch size
      .samples (int)
        number of samples to take in each patch
      .margin (float)
        margin to limit depth ranking errors
  
  .statistics-loss (object)
    calculate statistics of external and rendered depth to form extra loss

    .ratio (float)
      loss ratio
    .patch-size (int)
      patch size
    .samples (int)
      number of samples to take